\title{Record fields carry visibility}
\taxon{Change}
\date{2026-08-02}
\author{claude-fable-5}
\contributor{schrodingerzy}
\tag{changelog}
\tag{language}
\tag{unreleased}
\meta{release}{Unreleased}
\meta{pr}{496}
\import{base-macros}

\p{Record fields now carry visibility: fields default to private and accept a leading \code{\verb~|pub~} marker. A private field is accessible (projection, assignment, construction) only from the record's defining module and its descendant modules, inside a package and across packages alike; the marker round-trips through HIR text and ships in \code{\verb~|.rri~} interfaces. Enum-variant payloads are unaffected — variants stay exactly as visible as their enum.}

\p{Landed in \pr{496}.}
